 cut into 3 pieces\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Red onion|red onion]], [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Chilli|red chilli]], cut in 1 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]] pieces\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], beaten\n* 300 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Rice|hot rice]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Bok Choy|bok choy]], cut in 1 cm pieces\n* 200 g [[Cookbook:Pineapple|pineapple]] flesh, [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Heat the oil in a [[Cookbook:Non-stick|non-stick]] [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|skillet]]. Add the garlic, red onion, and red chilli. [[Cookbook:Stir-frying|Stir-fry]] for 2 minutes.\n# Add the egg, then the rice, bok choy, and diced pineapple.\n# Season with pepper and salt, and serve hot.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes for fried rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bok choy]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sunflower oil]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Pineapple Fried Rice","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"5 tbsp sunflower oil","sourceText":"5 tbsp sunflower oil","amountText":"5 tbsp sunflower oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 cloves garlic, cut into 3 pieces","sourceText":"3 cloves garlic, cut into 3 pieces","amountText":"3 cloves garlic, cut into 3 pieces","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 red onion, minced","sourceText":"3 red onion, minced","amountText":"3 red onion, minced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 red chilli, cut in 1 cm pieces","sourceText":"2 red chilli, cut in 1 cm pieces","amountText":"2 red chilli, cut in 1 cm pieces","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 eggs, beaten","sourceText":"2 eggs, bea